Subject: [PATCH] FIN-001: Resolve platform fee from platform_fee_bps only

Ignore commission_rate in economics.ResolvePlatformFeeBps so conflicting
legacy rows cannot diverge fees. Default remains 2000 bps (20%).
Requires human financial sign-off before merge.
